<title>MOLDOVA: Most Moldovan T-bill yields down, six-month steady.</title>
<headline>Most Moldovan T-bill yields down, six-month steady.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The annualised yield on Moldovan 28-day Treasury bills slipped to 25.25 percent at the most recent auction from 26.60 percent at the previous auction on December 17, a National Bank official told Reuters on Thursday.</p>
<p>The yield on 91-day T-bills fell to 26.06 percent from 27.88 percent. Six-month T-bills yielded 29.70 percent, the same as at the previous auction on November 26.</p>
<p>Full details of the 28-day T-bill auction:</p>
<p>						Dec 24	  Dec 17</p>
<p>    Issue volume			  3.00 million lei  3.00 million lei</p>
<p>    Denominations			 1,000 lei     1,000 lei</p>
<p>    Nominal demand			4.30 million	4.65 million</p>
<p>    Volume sold			   3.00 million	3.00 million</p>
<p>    Yield				   25.25 pct     26.60 pct</p>
<p>    Price				   98.1 pct	98.0 pct</p>
<p>    Range of bids			 98.1-98.5 pct 98.0-99.0 pct</p>
<p>    Maturity				Jan 23, 1997  Jan 16, 1997</p>
<p>Full details of the three-month T-bill auction:</p>
<p>						Dec 24	  Dec 17</p>
<p>    Issue volume			  12.00 million lei 10.00 million lei</p>
<p>    Denominations			 1,000 lei     1,000 lei</p>
<p>    Nominal demand			22.09 million     6.80 million</p>
<p>    Volume sold			   12.00 million     6.20 million</p>
<p>    Yield				   26.06 pct     27.88 pct</p>
<p>    Price				   93.9 pct	93.5 pct</p>
<p>    Range of bids			 93.9-95.5 pct 93.5-94.6pct</p>
<p>    Maturity				March 27,1997 March 20,1997</p>
<p>Full details of the six-month paper auction:</p>
<p>						Dec 24	   Nov 26</p>
<p>    Issue volume			  5.00 million lei   3.00 million lei</p>
<p>    Denominations			 1,000 lei	1,000 lei</p>
<p>    Nominal demand			3.11 million	 4.39 million</p>
<p>    Volume sold			   3.06 million	 3.00 million</p>
<p>    Yield				   29.70 pct	29.70 pct</p>
<p>    Price				   87.1 pct	 87.1 pct</p>
<p>    Range of bids			 87.1-90.0 pct  87.1-88.1</p>
<p>    Maturity				June 26, 1997  May 29, 1997</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
